# Shemsi AI

Shemsi AI is a Telegram-first personal AI agent platform inspired by Mira’s user experience but built with original branding and a Cloudflare-native architecture.

This project focuses on a real implementation skeleton with:

- Telegram bot webhook integration
- Cloudflare Worker backend
- Cloudflare Workers AI orchestration
- D1 memory and persistence
- App marketplace and secure connected app architecture
- Mini app dashboard UI
- scheduled/recurring automation scaffolding
